Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:03.90,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 国家银行公开赛（多伦多）1/4 决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:02:03.90,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}莱巴金娜 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&HFFFFFF&\fs44}4-6 7-6(5) 6-4{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 大坂直美 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.84,EN,,0,0,0,,This match started earlier than anticipated,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场比赛开始得比预期早
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.76,EN,,0,0,0,,but you certainly gave this crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.84,0:00:03.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你确实让这些观众
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:05.04,EN,,0,0,0,,their money's worth tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.76,0:00:05.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚看得值回票价
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:10.12,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations on a fantastic win.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.04,0:00:10.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜这场精彩的胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:11.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Can you walk me
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.64,0:00:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,能不能带我回顾一下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:13.76,EN,,0,0,0,,through that second set comeback that you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.36,0:00:13.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘那次逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.20,EN,,0,0,0,,had and how did you ultimately escape
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.76,0:00:15.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你最终是怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:16.56,EN,,0,0,0,,with the win?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.20,0:00:16.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,拿下这场胜利的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:17.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, honestly, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:17.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,说实话 我也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I was trying just to fight
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只是尽量在拼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:21.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh uh this uh first game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:21.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,开局那一局
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:25.76,EN,,0,0,0,,of the match uh was uh uh really tough
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很艰难
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,because it cost me the set,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.76,0:00:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为它让我丢了那一盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:29.76,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh then in the second I was just trying
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:29.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二盘我就尽量
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.72,EN,,0,0,0,,to stay closer to the score even if I'm losing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.76,0:00:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,咬住比分 哪怕在落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:35.44,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh yeah just fight and I'm super happy
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.72,0:00:35.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是一直拼 我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.48,EN,,0,0,0,,that I won this match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.44,0:00:36.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,能赢下这场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:38.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for coming
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.48,0:00:38.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:41.40,EN,,0,0,0,,and supporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.16,0:00:41.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,到场支持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Elena, you've practiced twice with Naomi,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.92,0:00:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,埃琳娜 你和大坂练过两次球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.12,EN,,0,0,0,,but hard to believe
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,却很难相信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:46.80,EN,,0,0,0,,that you've never faced each other
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.12,0:00:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你们俩
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:50.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in a WTA tour level match until tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:50.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,直到今晚才第一次交手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.36,EN,,0,0,0,,What surprised you about her game
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,她的球哪里让你意外
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and how did you have to adjust?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.36,0:00:53.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么调整的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:55.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's uh it's rare
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:55.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 这确实很少见
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:58.64,EN,,0,0,0,,when uh you don't play uh some players
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:58.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,有些球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.80,EN,,0,0,0,,for so many years you on tour
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.64,0:01:00.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,巡回赛打了这么多年却没碰过面
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:03.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh uh she's a great champion
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.80,0:01:03.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是一位伟大的冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:05.12,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh she's a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.52,0:01:05.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是一个斗士
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:06.80,EN,,0,0,0,,I knew that it's going to be a tough match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.12,0:01:06.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我知道这会是一场硬仗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.64,EN,,0,0,0,,We practiced as you said a couple times
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.80,0:01:08.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们像你说的那样练过几次球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh her ball is coming quite heavy
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.64,0:01:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,她的球很沉
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:13.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and also she can serve really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:13.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球也非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.00,EN,,0,0,0,,So the serve was uh really important today
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:16.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以今天发球特别关键
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:19.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh yeah I'm glad it went my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:19.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很高兴结果站在我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,You said against Samsonova that if you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.20,0:01:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你之前对萨姆索诺娃说过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,could fight you could turn it around.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,只要肯拼就能翻盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:24.40,EN,,0,0,0,,You did it again tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.12,0:01:24.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚你又做到了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:25.76,EN,,0,0,0,,How happy are you with the level
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.40,0:01:25.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你对这一周
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:27.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that you've been building throughout
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.76,0:01:27.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出来的这个状态
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,this week?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.12,0:01:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,满不满意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.40,0:01:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Uh I think that some moments
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得有些时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:33.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of course you also can get lucky
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.52,0:01:33.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,确实也需要一点运气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh it's not always good to be down
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,落后的时候不好受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:37.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh in and chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直在追分
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.28,EN,,0,0,0,,So uh yeah I'm glad
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:39.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我很高兴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:40.88,EN,,0,0,0,,that I have another opportunity
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.28,0:01:40.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我又有了一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:43.52,EN,,0,0,0,,but definitely each match I play I need to try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.88,0:01:43.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,但每一场我都要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:44.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to do better and better.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.52,0:01:44.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,争取打得更好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,So yeah, tomorrow is going
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.80,0:01:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:48.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to be another very difficult match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.40,0:01:48.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,又是一场很难打的比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and uh now my thoughts
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.40,0:01:49.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在我只想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.32,EN,,0,0,0,,are just to to recover and try to enjoy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:52.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,好好恢复 享受这一切
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Well Lena, you may say luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你可能会说这只是运气
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:56.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I saw ice cold determination especially
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.84,0:01:56.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我看到的是那种冷静的决心
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,in that final service game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是最后那个发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:59.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations. You're on to your second
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:01:59.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 你打进了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,National Bank Open semi-final.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.60,0:02:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,国家银行公开赛的第二个半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.36,0:02:02.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:03.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.24,0:02:03.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
